gnomato (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Panel popup: a countdown ring, the interval in words, the set as a row of
    tomatoes, and start/pause, skip and reset as round buttons. The popup opens
    on a left click, the menu with the day's count and the preferences moves to
    the right click. Styles live in stylesheet.css and ship with the package.

 -- Yegor Chuperka <yegor-chuperka@yandex.ru>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:40:00 +0000

gnomato (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: panel countdown, configurable pomodoro and break lengths,
    set order with auto-start policies, notifications with a theme sound,
    preferences window, and an append-only journal of finished intervals.

 -- Yegor Chuperka <yegor-chuperka@yandex.ru>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
